  (text "How to read: parts sit in functional blocks (dashed frames). Every pin ends in a short wire with its NET NAME; equal names are connected (also between blocks). A cross = intentionally unconnected pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.320 10.160 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "498b684c-d4a3-5d99-a7c3-3bd7252b2161"))
  (text "Diode symbols point anode to cathode. Pin names are those of the library; items marked VERIFY in docs/ASSUMPTIONS.md are unverified. MODELED design: not built, not bench-tested." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.320 14.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1c8a9bbe-eb35-592d-8af2-786922c72ac4"))
